'''Debilitate''' is a [[debuff]] that causes affected targets to deal 10% less [[damage]] and have 20% less [[movement speed]].

==Sources==
===Skill gems===
{{Query stat related skill gems
|type=active
|where = skill.description LIKE "%debilitate%" OR skill.stat_text LIKE "%debilitate%"
|stat_page=Debilitate 
}}

